sequenceDiagram

  actor CL as ZAS clinician
  participant HIX as Chipsoft HiX
  participant BFF as Professional BFF
  participant CORE as Core service
  participant AME as Access Management Engine
  participant BUS as Event bus
  participant LUI as Luscii integration layer
  participant LUS as Luscii Clinical Engine<br/>Class IIa
  participant EHRI as EHR integration layer
  participant NOT as Notification subsystem
  actor PT as Patient
  autonumber

  Note over CL,PT: Clinician starts a care pathway from HiX (e.g. post-operative monitoring)<br/>Reaktor Care Pathway Composer handles admin steps<br/>Luscii Care Pathway Builder defines the clinical sub-path block.
  CL->>HIX: Open patient record
  CL->>BFF: SMART-launch app flow, see Story 2<br/>Click Open care pathway app
  BFF->>CORE: GET available pathway templates<br/>scoped to specialism + erkenning
  CORE-->>BFF: Pathway template list

  CL->>BFF: Select Post-operative monitoring<br/>+ fill order form (target measurements,<br/>duration, opt-in IC text version)
  BFF->>AME: Authorise pathway start<br/>role, specialism, therapeutic relationship
  AME-->>BFF: Authorised

  BFF->>CORE: POST /pathway-instance<br/>template_id, patient_id, encounter_id,<br/>responsible_clinician, parameters

  CORE->>CORE: Validate template version,<br/>create pathway instance,<br/>bind to published version

  par Create encounter / DocRef in HiX
    CORE->>EHRI: POST encounter context<br/>+ pathway DocumentReference<br/>FHIR R4
    EHRI->>HIX: POST DocumentReference<br/>+ link to Encounter
    HIX-->>EHRI: Resource IDs
    EHRI-->>CORE: HiX-side IDs (encounter, doc)
  and Activate clinical sub-path in Luscii
    CORE->>LUI: POST /enrolment<br/>patient, Luscii program, parameters
    LUI->>LUS: Create patient enrolment<br/>in Luscii program<br/>Class IIa-published version
    LUS-->>LUI: Enrolment ID, schedule
    LUI-->>CORE: Luscii enrolment confirmed
  end

  CORE->>BUS: Emit PathwayStarted event<br/>patient_id, pathway_id, IDs

  par Notify patient
    BUS->>NOT: Subscribe → patient enrolment notification
    NOT->>PT: Push notification + email + SMS<br/>New pathway started — please<br/>complete informed consent
  and Notify clinician
    BUS->>NOT: Subscribe → clinician confirmation
    NOT->>EHRI: Create task in HiX task list<br/>FHIR Task
    EHRI->>HIX: POST Task
    HIX-->>CL: Task appears in clinician inbox
  and Audit
    BUS->>EHRI: Audit event → write Provenance<br/>FHIR R4 into HiX
    EHRI->>HIX: POST Provenance<br/>pathway start, actor, timestamp
  end

  Note over PT,LUS: Patient now sees the pathway timeline in the Reaktor app<br/>RPM tasks surface in the Luscii app via the Luscii SDK.

  PT->>LUS: First measurement<br/>see Story 4 for the alert path

  Note over CL,PT: Order-form behaviour and HiX-side resource set depend on what<br/>Chipsoft enables on the HiX integration side (Newwave Care liaises).